# DMV Throwers Website — UI Kit

## Overview
High-fidelity interactive prototype of the **dmvthrowers.club** main club website.

## Design System
- **Colors:** `--red: #B80000`, `--navy: #102040`, `--cream: #fffdfa`
- **Type:** Playfair Display (display/headings) + DM Sans (body/UI)
- **Corner radius:** 0 everywhere — all square corners
- **Buttons:** Rectangular, uppercase, letter-spaced

## Screens
| Screen | Description |
|---|---|
| Home | Hero, about section, stats, VSYC callout |
| Events | Monthly meetup cards, location banner |
| Gallery | Photo grid |
| FAQ | Accordion FAQ |
| Contact | Contact info + message form |

## Components (JSX files)
- `Nav.jsx` — Sticky nav with top bar and brand lockup
- `Hero.jsx` — Full-screen navy hero with dot pattern and DC skyline
- `EventCard.jsx` — Monthly meetup card + events section
- `Footer.jsx` — Navy footer with brand + links

## Usage
Include all JSX files via `<script type="text/babel" src="...">` after React and Babel.
The `colors_and_type.css` in the root should be imported for all CSS variables.
